Async Alembic environment for test-management-service.

The database URL is resolved in env.py with the same precedence as
src/db/session.py: the DATABASE_URL environment variable first, then the
service settings (SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URL). The driver is normalized to an
async driver (asyncpg for Postgres) so migrations run in an async context.

Usage (from the service directory, services/test-management-service):

    # apply all migrations
    DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://user:pass@host:5432/db alembic upgrade head

    # roll back the most recent migration
    alembic downgrade -1

    # generate a new draft migration (always review it)
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
